#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.rst:136
msgid "Unit tests"
msgstr "单元测试"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.rst:139
msgid ""
"The Unit tests require `NVIDIA Inference Xfer Library (NIXL) "
"<https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl>`_ to be installed. Please follow the "
"details in the NIXL GitHub repo to install. The NIXL unit tests also "
"require `vLLM <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm>`_ and `msgpack "
"<https://github.com/msgpack/msgpack-python/>`_. If you are unable to "
"install NIXL you can circumvent the NIXL unit tests by using the "
"following pytest flags: `--ignore=tests/disagg "
"--ignore=tests/v1/test_pos_kernels.py "
"--ignore=tests/v1/test_nixl_storage.py`."
msgstr "单元测试需要安装 `NVIDIA Inference Xfer Library (NIXL) <https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl>`_。请按照 NIXL GitHub 仓库中的详细信息进行安装。NIXL 单元测试还需要 `vLLM <https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm>`_ 和 `msgpack <https://github.com/msgpack/msgpack-python/>`_。如果您无法安装 NIXL，可以使用以下 pytest 标志绕过 NIXL 单元测试：`--ignore=tests/disagg --ignore=tests/v1/test_pos_kernels.py --ignore=tests/v1/test_nixl_storage.py`。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.rst:143
msgid ""
"When making changes, run the tests before pushing the changes. Running "
"unit tests ensures your contributions do not break exiting code. We use "
"the `pytest <https://docs.pytest.org/>`_ framework to run unit tests. The"
" framework is setup to run all files in the `tests "
"<https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/tests>`_ directory which "
"have a prefix or posfix of \"test\"."
msgstr "进行更改时，在推送更改之前运行测试。运行单元测试可确保您的贡献不会破坏现有代码。我们使用 `pytest <https://docs.pytest.org/>`_ 框架运行单元测试。该框架设置为运行 `tests <https://github.com/LMCache/LMCache/tree/dev/tests>`_ 目录中前缀或后缀为 \"test\" 的所有文件。"

