#: ../../source/developer_guide/contributing.rst:188
msgid ""
"Thank you for your contribution to LMCache and making it a better, and "
"accessible framework for all."
msgstr "感谢您对 LMCache 的贡献，让它成为一个更好、更易用的框架，造福所有人。"

